  "title": "· New Bags | Balenciaga Unveils Summer 27 Runway Collection: Coral Realm ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Balenciaga 发布夏季27系列时装秀：珊瑚万象",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga's Summer 27 Paris show, themed Corals of Freedom, blends couture craft into sculptural everyday wear with a white-to-red palette.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
