    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Balenciaga Summer 27 show has just wrapped in Paris, and this season's collection takes \"Les Coraux de la Liberté\" (Corals of Freedom) as its theme. Creative director Pierpaolo Piccioli brings the artisanal techniques of the house's haute couture ateliers to the varied silhouettes of both womenswear and menswear, giving everyday pieces a fresh, sculptural dimension. The palette moves gradually from white and ivory into orange and red, using the regenerative nature of coral as a metaphor for the resilience, heritage and vitality of the couture house.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
