    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· The Nodo Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new season's bags come in soft, slouchy shapes and a vivid palette of bright orange, neon pink, cobalt blue and pale lilac, exuding an easy, relaxed attitude. The newly introduced Nodo bag is shaped by hand: supple, finely grained leather is pinched and folded by artisans to create natural creases and fluid lines, while knotted details at either side lend the bag a full, three-dimensional form and an elegant flourish. A detachable key charm hangs from one side of the strap, adding a carefree, grab-and-go feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
