    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This bag is pieced together from diagonally cut grained leather. The bias-cut technique gives it a naturally draped silhouette, and a single metal hook closure serves as its only decorative fastening — a minimalist, gender-neutral design that feels effortlessly at ease.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
