    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This shoulder bag pairs a vintage saddle silhouette with a curved top frame, its compact, rounded shape carrying a distinctly classic charm. A square metal clasp engraved with the BALENCIAGA PARIS logo is accented with a circular ring, adding a lively detail — you can also use it to clip on a bag charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
