    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The classic Rodeo bag features a contrast lining inside and out, with the naturally draped opening subtly revealing the bright interior — understated, yet with a clever little twist. The new Rodeo belt bag, worn at the waist, visually elongates the silhouette and adds a striking note to the overall look.",
      "url": null,
